<h1>Translating</h1>

{{#> Columns}}
{{#> Column}}

<p>The translated character sheets are made possible by volunteers.</p>

<h3>How it works</h3>

<p>There are too many pages to expect one person to translate all of them, so this is a team effort. We care about the consistency and quality of the translations, and many of the labels are repeated, so volunteers don't edit pages directly.</p>

<p>Instead there's a website where volunteers can work together. Instead of whole pages, they translate line by line. Volunteers can enter alternative translations, and vote for which they prefer.</p>

<h3>How to volunteer</h3>

<p>If you'd like to help out, send me a message - on this site, or on Discord or Facebook.</p>

